# License directory

Place the MAC-locked `license.lic` file here on each server. **Do not commit the `.lic` file.**

Generate on a build machine:

```bash
cd backend
LICENSE_SECRET_KEY=your-32-char-secret HOST_MAC=aa:bb:cc:dd:ee:ff node generate-prod-license.js ../production/license/license.lic
```

Copy `license.lic` to the prod server at `production/license/license.lic` (Docker mount).

See `docs/LICENSE-DEPLOY.md`.
